                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mtu mmoja akimkosea mwenzake, Mungu atamhukumu; lakini mtu akimkosea BWANA, ni nani atakayemtetea? Lakini hawakuisikia sauti ya baba yao, kwa sababu BWANA amekusudia kuwaua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
