            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEC.8.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zek 8:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nawe utayatazama mateso ya maskani yangu, katika utajiri wote watakaopewa Israeli; wala nyumbani mwako hapatakuwako mzee milele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tena mtu wako, ambaye sitamtenga na madhabahu yangu, atakuwa mtu wa kukupofusha macho, na kukuhuzunisha moyo; tena wazao wote wa nyumba yako watakufa watakapokuwa watu wazima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2:33",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Tafsiri zingine zina ‘watauawa kwa upanga’.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
